# Files not uploaded to Cloud Build when deploying the backend.
#
# IMPORTANT: this file must exist. Without it, gcloud falls back to .gitignore,
# which would exclude .env from the upload. We WANT .env uploaded (it carries the
# Atlas creds the backend reads at runtime) but NOT committed to git — so it
# stays in .gitignore and is deliberately absent from this list.
# Trade-off: the secret ends up in the built image. Accepted.
.git/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
scratchpad/
tests/
scripts/
web.py
console_*.png
MEMORY.md
WRITEUP.md
WORKLOADS.md
